<dt>Page ownership</dt><dd>Which existing page should serve which country, and what needs a local version.</dd>
<dt>hreflang and canonical tags</dt><dd>Specified for your developer and checked after release, as part of <a href="/technical-seo-services-philippines/">technical SEO</a>.</dd>
